{{LimitedContent}}
'''882-1''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Catnip Challenges]] during the [[Anniversary/14th Year|14th Anniversary]]. It was added in [[Version 16.0 Update|Version 16.0]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 882
|rarity = EX
|name1 = 882-1
|name2 = 882-2
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''882-2''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
A relatively weak anti-[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] crowd-controller. 882-2 can be viable early into [[Stories of Legend]] as a counter to [[Bore]], as well as [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] prior to unlocking [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]. Beyond that point, 882-2's particularly decent against [[Hannya]] as one of the only easily accessible means of controlling her, in both [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|Realm of Carnage]] and [[Wrath of Carnage (Deadly)|Wrath of Carnage]]. It… also has a pretty sick mohawk, for whatever that's worth.

{{Job|Classification = Rusher & Crowd-Controller}}

